  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38348460",
      "title": "Outputting Key Concepts Data",
      "sourceHash": "02077175777021504474098eece99af5c069e7cbb509e4e3e6d163019c05dd96",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "So let's now solve these tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.36,
          "en": "And for that, of course, we're going to start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 10.803,
          "en": "with the first task where we output the key concepts data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.15,
          "end": 14.4,
          "en": "Now, the data is already here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "in app js in this concepts array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 22.08,
          "en": "And now, the goal is to output that data down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.08,
          "end": 24.84,
          "en": "And if you take a look at this unordered list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.84,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "where the concept data should be output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.96,
          "en": "you can see that I already got one list item there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.96,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "but at the moment, it only contains dummy content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 37.413,
          "en": "only dummy data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.413,
          "end": 39.57,
          "en": "That now needs to be replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 42.9,
          "en": "with the actual data from these objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.9,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "And as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 47.016,
          "en": "the goal is now not to copy and paste that data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.016,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "but instead to dynamically access the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "in that concepts array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "And in React, you can do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 57.84,
          "en": "by using single curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.84,
          "end": 62.643,
          "en": "as you learned opening and closing single curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 65.61,
          "en": "Between those curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "you can put any JavaScript expression that yields a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 73.23,
          "en": "You could, for example, put one plus one in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 75.06,
          "en": "But, of course, that's not the goal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "Instead, here for the image, I want to refer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "to this image or precisely to the value stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 86.733,
          "en": "under the image key in this first object in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "So, this value stored under this image key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 93.243,
          "en": "in the first object of this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.71000000000001,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "To output that image here, we can go to this source here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "So, between those curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.34,
          "end": 104.10300000000001,
          "en": "reference this Concepts array by its name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "And then, since it's an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 108.96000000000001,
          "en": "and I want to access the first element in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.96000000000001,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "I can use square brackets zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 115.17,
          "en": "which does access the first element in that array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.17,
          "end": 118.233,
          "en": "And that first element will be this object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "And then, this object I now want to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "to that value that's stored under the key image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "So therefore, we can use the dot notation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.53,
          "en": "and access image like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 132.753,
          "en": "And this will output the image here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 137.16,
          "en": "Now, I also want to set the alt text dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.16,
          "end": 140.04,
          "en": "and I wanna set this to the title of this concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.04,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "And therefore, here we again need curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "to dynamically output some content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.57999999999998,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "And then, we use concepts again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "square bracket zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 154.26,
          "en": "because we're still working on the same Concepts object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.26,
          "end": 157.983,
          "en": "And then, dot title gives us access to the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.09,
          "end": 161.199,
          "en": "And that's actually also exactly the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.199,
          "end": 165.39,
          "en": "I need down here to output the title as text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 167.163,
          "en": "So, between those H2 tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.21,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "And then, here, for the paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "where I want to output the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 175.413,
          "en": "I want to access Concepts, zero description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 178.77,
          "en": "With that, we should be outputting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "about the first key concept in that Concepts array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "Now, to see this in action here on my local machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 188.04,
          "en": "I need to start this development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 190.712,
          "en": "which in Visual Studio Code can be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.712,
          "end": 193.77,
          "en": "by opening a new terminal and running NPM start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.77,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "Though, for this to succeed, I first must run NPM install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.09,
          "en": "to install all those extra dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.09,
          "end": 204.63,
          "en": "including that build process that's used behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.63,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "And you only need to do this once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 209.94,
          "en": "as you learned when you initially set up a project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 212.733,
          "en": "And thereafter, we can run NPM start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.733,
          "end": 216.54,
          "en": "and this will now start that development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.54,
          "end": 219.09199999999998,
          "en": "And then, once I visit local host 3000",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.09199999999998,
          "end": 223.263,
          "en": "I can indeed see this key concept here on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.28,
          "end": 226.425,
          "en": "It's quite big for me here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.425,
          "end": 227.61,
          "en": "because I zoomed in quite a bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.61,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "so that you can see it really well as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 233.04,
          "en": "And I got a light hover effect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.04,
          "end": 235.683,
          "en": "but clicking doesn't actually do anything here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.56900000000002,
          "end": 237.69,
          "en": "It's just a visual effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.69,
          "end": 241.23,
          "en": "But, this is now the first key concept being output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.23,
          "end": 244.061,
          "en": "It's not the only key concept we got though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.061,
          "end": 248.37,
          "en": "Instead, if we take a look here at this Concepts array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.37,
          "end": 251.713,
          "en": "we of course got two more objects in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.713,
          "end": 256.62,
          "en": "And the goal, of course, is to also output those concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.62,
          "end": 260.056,
          "en": "And therefore, what we can do for now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.056,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "and what will change later is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 263.67,
          "en": "that we copy and paste this list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 267.27,
          "en": "And now, access Concepts one image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.27,
          "end": 270.24,
          "en": "Concepts one title also here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.24,
          "end": 273.24,
          "en": "and also Concepts one description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.24,
          "end": 275.4,
          "en": "And this will access the second element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.4,
          "end": 276.75,
          "en": "in this Concepts array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.75,
          "end": 278.64,
          "en": "And then, access image, title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.64,
          "end": 281.90999999999997,
          "en": "and description for that second element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.90999999999997,
          "end": 283.332,
          "en": "And, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.332,
          "end": 285.21,
          "en": "we can then also repeat this one last time here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.21,
          "end": 287.28,
          "en": "for the third element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 287.28,
          "end": 290.28,
          "en": "where we dare for access Concepts two image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.28,
          "end": 293.43,
          "en": "Concepts two title also here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.43,
          "end": 295.683,
          "en": "and Concepts two description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.61,
          "end": 301.05,
          "en": "And with that, we'll be outputting all three concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 301.05,
          "end": 304.74,
          "en": "for the moment simply by copy and pasting this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.74,
          "end": 306.753,
          "en": "But, that of course will change soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 309.66,
          "en": "If you save that though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 309.66,
          "end": 312.63,
          "en": "and you got that development server up and running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 312.63,
          "end": 316.773,
          "en": "you will now see these three key concepts on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.94,
          "end": 320.91,
          "en": "And that, theoretically is of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 320.91,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "already the final solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 325.803,
          "en": "It's the final website we want to build here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 326.94,
          "end": 331.08,
          "en": "but it's not the final solution for those tasks I gave you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 331.08,
          "end": 334.2,
          "en": "It's only the solution for the first task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 334.2,
          "end": 336.78,
          "en": "because whilst we got a working solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.78,
          "end": 340.68,
          "en": "we don't have the best possible working solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.68,
          "end": 345.42,
          "en": "Instead, the next task is to identify possible components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 345.42,
          "end": 349.14300000000003,
          "en": "before we then also build and use those components.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
